# Build context for node/docker/Dockerfile (run from the repo root). The image
# only copies a few requirement files and the toolchain file; keep the rest,
# and anything per-machine or secret, out of the context.
.git
.venv
site
**/build*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
node/node.conf
node/.deploy.conf
node/captures
AGENTS.local.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.remember
docs/private
